OL,3,ALegal challenge to Australia's social
OL,4,Amedia ban to start in High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo days of hearings on a challenge to
OL,7,FAustralia's landmark social media ban
OL,8,Ffor children will begin at the
OL,9,Fcountry's highest court on Tuesday.
OL,11,FIn a major test of the world-leading
OL,12,Fpolicy, a digital rights group will
OL,13,Fargue that the ban for under-16s robs
OL,14,Fchildren of their right to free
OL,15,Fcommunication. A separate challenge
OL,16,Flaunched by platform Reddit will be
OL,17,Fjointly heard.
OL,19,FIntroduced last December, the ban is a
OL,20,Fkey part of sweeping changes the
OL,21,FAustralian government has spearheaded
OL,22,Fin recent years on online safety.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
