OL,3,ALegal challenge to Australia's social
OL,4,Amedia ban to start in High Court
OL,5,
OL,6,FSupporters say the ban protects
OL,7,Fchildren from harmful content but
OL,8,Fcritics say it is too blunt an
OL,9,Finstrument and efforts should focus on
OL,10,Fimproving online safety.
